648,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6tT0n4","user":{"login":"PabloDevGit","id":19652075,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NjUyMDc1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19652075?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloDevGit","html_url":"https://github.com/PabloDevGit","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloDevGit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloDevGit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloDevGit/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloDevGit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloDevGit/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloDevGit/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloDevGit/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloDevGit/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PabloDevGit/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-25T07:04:18Z","updated_at":"2025-05-28T10:11:31Z","body":"The crash occurs because the 'cuerpo' reference becomes null when the finger is lifted from the left or right direction. At that moment, 'StateMachine.change_to(StateMachine.ESTADO_DETENIDO)' is executed, which changes the node's script, and the 'cuerpo' reference becomes null. That line is then executed and causes a crash.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2907654648/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2994444126","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106778#issuecomment-2994444126","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106778","id":2994444126,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ye5d